*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Expo nests the embedded prototype's vendored assets (Raleway, expo-router
# icons) under a literal "assets/node_modules/" path inside its build output.
# Those are shipped files, not dependencies — without this the deployed
# prototype silently falls back to a system font.
!public/case-studies/*/prototype/assets/node_modules/
